===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable|slang}} Sticky matter accumulated between digits of a foot.
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[stubbed]] toe. {{rfex|en}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} A rock-climbing maneuver entailing exerting force with two opposite surfaces of the toe of a shod foot, against two different rock surfaces, for the purpose of preventing motion of that foot in a direction parallel to both of those rock surfaces.

